{"type":"message","id":"9e52cf82","parentId":"ad16f9ab","timestamp":"2026-06-04T06:17:32.011Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read_ts_AY89a1_i_mh6WWaxZZAKvjZgji2PyeAwFOj0H5ifIemfcvx_NyESkPv5SCQEWApAnmXL6ZRhFv4z_EG9Sf8TDvZKndB2BRafsrxlDkIHqocL7qdnKKwUngw4oKJIHMN43LeLgv9tPIIypzi17EqndMUdaLH32MA0FfbZxYwyXTmDk7nIOuKo9JAWnq360NygSFW799p8PTyrTnQo8y6qLvJALJa46Ha_uRl7g_jwiPmLz-309WbN-UaAQqH6rZqDj5JNHHdo0M5Pt5vx3p_osel_GckokqhXBLxbsKn9HpgKeaaQffejN3yMhf5l7trri2hiKGLIgdiGaW7CBMKJVRpbyrEh0dlugcQVUZ2V0ZyPwaYyuRI-By0K_4UeyPLewYzJGguyyG2LIdujHkRPXpTb1XcQxeeeYnpBtGehg3Pq-U6SFuxZ9LQTolV8l7235GvQze0ERPgvVkD17alXFc0eCfjCFlYN-I03pSHcMiqkeZoXFm6M9Qr_aiTVt4eL5re58GQdcHJor8pHvDi6mnCga7FDK-or6XcOSu3Rp2Hfd7QrBJSjow0DjYB44ixuMTdOFt8d7tiCx9Bu7d2Re-VAPwyjb-PJvm3LBfgyde26eafynXWO_ZVB3jUMbsjZPVZhQOpgAnTsGwnYid0smRzFd2dRpBEu_JWrtx3qLB4L1SWQjFJEm73eWjl_fFY6TAsPpeRWT6NkWjP3yQW_YbcttDg9VQ_hfFZFiZgZvLVcUJgaQe4q6FFN29y-5ioNK49yJdr3NyBkD4u781chNn3O8X6g4Skf7FcSdq9OdjwyhU4V0WiNIDNFupBJMiM2GmHcBs2Mn1Qh2r55HFN2JNouoNpVg5OTCD4-yY5raOIsNw_VwS1cNF5qrk0upY7KxhHAygLZVPMc99sncumVoPYjDYdCth7u8xkc7PptnHU0eJ7vHNO5fV01H72VgzAz1AUZb4aKMlPItsQBZFjESvIgg11I-YX47AFmbP6p9kzYBg64oRwaF07yRzPiFfupIgptVh2fbDi--V2oGp6xOIjx3jFj240Otz-NwFDRbw8NdInyzoKHlp48oYpYcywzUa8iSUspAhROfGlur7xga7UG2lpzAy7iiWz6jwKRy-Er","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: gog\ndescription: Google Workspace CLI for Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs.\nhomepage: https://gogcli.sh\nmetadata: {\"clawdbot\":{\"emoji\":\"🎮\",\"requires\":{\"bins\":[\"gog\"]},\"install\":[{\"id\":\"brew\",\"kind\":\"brew\",\"formula\":\"steipete/tap/gogcli\",\"bins\":[\"gog\"],\"label\":\"Install gog (brew)\"}]}}\n---\n\n# gog\n\nUse `gog` for Gmail/Calendar/Drive/Contacts/Sheets/Docs. Requires OAuth setup.\n\nSetup (once)\n- `gog auth credentials /path/to/client_secret.json`\n- `gog auth add you@gmail.com --services gmail,calendar,drive,contacts,sheets,docs`\n- `gog auth list`\n\nCommon commands\n- Gmail search: `gog gmail search 'newer_than:7d' --max 10`\n- Gmail send: `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body \"Hello\"`\n- Calendar: `gog calendar events <calendarId> --from <iso> --to <iso>`\n- Drive search: `gog drive search \"query\" --max 10`\n- Contacts: `gog contacts list --max 20`\n- Sheets get: `gog sheets get <sheetId> \"Tab!A1:D10\" --json`\n- Sheets update: `gog sheets update <sheetId> \"Tab!A1:B2\" --values-json '[[\"A\",\"B\"],[\"1\",\"2\"]]' --input USER_ENTERED`\n- Sheets append: `gog sheets append <sheetId> \"Tab!A:C\" --values-json '[[\"x\",\"y\",\"z\"]]' --insert INSERT_ROWS`\n- Sheets clear: `gog sheets clear <sheetId> \"Tab!A2:Z\"`\n- Sheets metadata: `gog sheets metadata <sheetId> --json`\n- Docs export: `gog docs export <docId> --format txt --out /tmp/doc.txt`\n- Docs cat: `gog docs cat <docId>`\n\nNotes\n- Set `GOG_ACCOUNT=you@gmail.com` to avoid repeating `--account`.\n- For scripting, prefer `--json` plus `--no-input`.\n- Sheets values can be passed via `--values-json` (recommended) or as inline rows.\n- Docs supports export/cat/copy. In-place edits require a Docs API client (not in gog).\n- Confirm before sending mail or creating events.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780553852011}}
